  "prefLabel": "Agr 103.02 Office of Commissioner",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Agr 103.02 Office of Commissioner. The office of the commissioner shall administer departmental affairs, develop policy and oversee such programs as the statutes direct, including the state agricultural land development rights purchase program and state conservation committee. All accounting activities for the department shall be included in this unit. The office of commissioner shall provide administrative support to the agricultural advisory board.\n\nSource. #6012, eff 3-28-95",
